Provenance: adapted from
https://github.com/GeoZcx/A-deeply-supervised-image-fusion-network-for-change-detection-in-remote-sensing-images
("A deeply supervised image fusion network for change detection in high
resolution bi-temporal remote sensing images", ISPRS 2021)

The upstream repository ships NO separate LICENSE file. Its README states,
verbatim:

    License
    Code and datasets are released for non-commercial and research
    purposes only. For commercial purposes, please contact the authors.

Consequence for this distribution: the `src/models/DSIFN/` component is
RESEARCH-ONLY / NON-COMMERCIAL. It must not be used for commercial purposes
without written permission from the DSIFN authors. For the repository-wide
licensing decision see NOTICE and README ("License").
